WEBVTT

00:01:29.121 --> 00:01:30.496
made up of 12 regional banks

00:01:30.496 --> 00:01:32.454
in the biggest cities of the country.

00:01:32.454 --> 00:01:33.954
Its board of governors,

00:01:33.954 --> 00:01:36.913
who is appointed by the President
and validated by the Senate,

00:01:36.913 --> 00:01:37.954
report to Congress,

00:01:37.954 --> 00:01:41.288
and all the benefits of the FED
are intended for state treasuries.

00:01:41.288 --> 00:01:45.329
But to protect the FED
from the influence of the political life,

00:01:45.329 --> 00:01:48.371
it is not under the control of any
powers of government.

00:01:48.746 --> 00:01:51.913
So why the FED wouldn’t
just print $100 bills until infinity ?

00:01:51.996 --> 00:01:54.163
So that everyone is happy and rich?

00:01:54.163 --> 00:01:57.079
Well, because then the tickets
would no longer have any value.

00:01:57.079 --> 00:01:58.704
Think about the purpose of money,

00:01:58.704 --> 00:02:01.663
who is to be exchanged
against goods and services.